OL,3,AMajor UK airports hit by air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of flights into and out of the
OL,7,FUK have been cancelled following a
OL,8,Ftechnical problem affecting the air
OL,9,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,11,FAt least 1,000 flights in or out of the
OL,12,Fcountry have been cancelled, according
OL,13,Fto tracking website FlightRadar24.
OL,14,FEasyJet has made 200 cancellations and
OL,15,FBritish Airways has made more than 100.
OL,17,FNats said on Tuesday evening that its
OL,18,Fflight systems were starting to
OL,19,Frecover.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
